claimed: intent-other-collapse — the Other bucket collapses (measured 2026-09-03: recall 0.17 with reasoning first, 0.00 without, every out-of-domain message absorbed into a positive class). NOTE the baseline was measured with a BARE prompt, while the shipped Classify.prompt already carries a none-of-the-above line that was never measured — so step one is finding out whether what landed already fixes it, before adding anything. Then, in order: Other examples in the prompt, and a separate binary in-domain gate ahead of the taxonomy. Each arm against the same 24-message fixture, compared with Eval.regressions rather than by eye; the fixture becomes a test resource so the next lane reuses it instead of inventing one.
